{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n各位芫荽狂熱愛好者注意！大家可以令家充滿芫荽香味啦！MUJI推出話題新作「芫荽味香薰蠟燭」，一登場便引爆網民討論了！這款蠟燭從前調的馬鞭草、香檸檬與芫荽揭開序幕，初聞散發清新明亮的青草花果香；細味之下，中調揉合清透茉莉花香，尾韻則轉為沉穩木質調與標誌性的芫荽根氣息，完美還原新鮮切段芫荽的濃郁「青汁」感，彷彿一頭扎進芫荽火鍋湯底！點燃後香氣會變得更柔和中性，為家居注入獨特草本綠意，不過暫時只有內地MUJI分店有售。\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475843617479808_6774675376af9d724eb89e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475843617479808_6774675376af9d724eb89e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475843895868276_3505795446af9d72769088.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475843895868276_3505795446af9d72769088.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475844076162111_10762604686af9d7296e635.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475844076162111_10762604686af9d7296e635.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfw8ihqDPhE/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:24:51.161663+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T17:1